[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0160","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0399","title":"Caucho Technology Resin JavaBean 源码泄露漏洞","description":"Caucho Resin 1.3b1 及更早版本存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP 请求的 WEB-INF 路径前插入 `.jsp` 后缀，绕过 Servlet 容器的访问限制，直接读取 JavaBean 文件的源代码。该漏洞可导致应用程序的敏感业务逻辑、数据库连接信息及配置参数泄露，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过构造特制 URL 远程利用，影响范围包括 Caucho Resin 1.2 和 1.3 系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0399"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:14.087","remediation":"升级至 Caucho Resin 1.3.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复通过 `.jsp` 前缀绕过 WEB-INF 目录限制的问题。由于 Resin 1.x 系列早已停止维护，建议迁移至 Resin 4.0.x 或更高版本，同时在 `web.xml` 中添加 `<security-constraint>` 规则禁止外部直接访问 `/WEB-INF/*` 路径，作为纵深防御措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98633597813833&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2533","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20722","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0399.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0399","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0399.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0399.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2023/caucho/gb_resin_CVE-2001-0399_active.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qv37-qfq4-c558/GHSA-qv37-qfq4-c558.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/Caucho%20Technology%20Resin%20JavaBean%E6%B3%84%E6%BC%8F%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-0399).html","https://github.com/chushuai/wscan/blob/d154617a1da7302d292d7c3cce9dce39d85ddb0c/data/db_server.xml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0399.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0160.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0160.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0160.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0155","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0383","title":"PHP-Nuke 远程广告横幅URL修改漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 的 banners.php 脚本中存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者可直接调用 Change 操作修改广告横幅链接地址，因该操作未对用户身份进行认证。攻击者无需任何权限即可将广告链接替换为恶意 URL，导致用户被重定向至钓鱼或恶意站点。该漏洞影响 PHP-Nuke 4.4 及更早版本，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0383"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:12.247","remediation":"升级 PHP-Nuke 至 5.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在官方修复包中修补。如无法升级，在 banners.php 开头添加身份验证检查代码，限制 Change 操作仅允许管理员执行；或在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面通过 .htaccess 对 banners.php 目录设置访问认证，阻止未授权外部请求直接调用 Change 参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0017.html","http://phpnuke.org/download.php?dcategory=Fixes","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2544","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6342","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0383.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0383","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0383.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c2rq-2x5w-5prm/GHSA-c2rq-2x5w-5prm.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/php_nuke_installed.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0383.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--00ee9534-e6fa-4858-aae3-d7d6b389e938.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0154","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0154.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0380","title":"Crosscom Olicom XLT-F XL 80 IM SNMP 默认 Community 字符串漏洞","description":"Crosscom/Olicom XLT-F XL 80 IM 设备（固件版本 V5.5 Build Level 2）存在默认 SNMP 团体字符串漏洞。设备内置了未公开的默认团体字符串 \"ILMI\"，远程攻击者无需认证即可利用该字符串通过 SNMP 协议读取或修改设备配置信息，可能导致敏感信息泄露或设备配置被篡改。该漏洞影响特定版本的 Olicom XLT-F 系列网络设备，攻击者只需网络可达即可利用，无需任何身份验证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0380"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:11.897","remediation":"立即修改 SNMP 默认 community string，删除或更改 'ILMI' 为自定义复杂字符串；在设备 ACL 中限制 SNMP 仅允许受信管理 IP 段访问；在边界防火墙上阻断 UDP 161/162 端口的外部访问。建议联系厂商确认是否有固件更新可彻底修复此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0364.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5718","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20892","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0380","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0380.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0380.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fx24-mh4f-pc7p/GHSA-fx24-mh4f-pc7p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88839/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0380.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/snmp_default_communities.nasl","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2014/gb_snmp_get_community.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0154.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0153","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0153.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0375","title":"Cisco PIX 防火墙 TACACS+ 认证请求洪水拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco PIX 防火墙 515 和 520 设备运行 5.1.4 版本操作系统时，其 TACACS+ 认证模块存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标设备发送大量认证请求即可导致 CPU 资源耗尽，使防火墙无法正常处理网络流量。该漏洞影响 Cisco PIX 4.x/5.x 系列固件，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0375"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:11.333","remediation":"升级 Cisco PIX OS 至 5.3.1 或更新版本。5.3.1 已验证不会因认证请求洪泛而崩溃，仅记录\"too many pending auths\"并拒绝超量请求。同时可在 aaa-server 配置中缩短 timeout 值（如设为 3 秒），并启用审计日志监控异常认证流量作为补充缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98658271707833&w=2","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/pixfirewall-authen-flood-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2551","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6353","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20734","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0375.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0375","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0375.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0375.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gpjg-cgg8-v765/GHSA-gpjg-cgg8-v765.json","https://github.com/arpitn30/nipper-ng/blob/a344e58392d528c168b74ccda5caa309923fff56/0.11.10/common/.svn/text-base/report-vulns.c.svn-base","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0375.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1e8434e4-e747-4356-9479-689351b954ac.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0106","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0265","title":"PGP 5.x/6.x/7.0 ASCII Armor 解析器任意文件创建漏洞","description":"Windows 平台 PGP 5.x、6.x 及 7.0.3 及更早版本中的 ASCII Armor 解析器存在任意文件创建漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的恶意 ASCII 装甲格式文件，当用户使用受影响版本 PGP 处理该文件时，解析器未能正确校验文件路径，导致可在任意目录创建文件。该漏洞 CVSS 评分仅 2.1，危害等级低，攻击复杂度高，需用户交互触发。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0265"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59.490","remediation":"立即升级到 PGP 7.0.4 或更高版本以修复 ASCII Armor 解析器路径遍历缺陷。PGP Desktop 产品线已停止维护，建议迁移至 GnuPG 等活跃维护的 OpenPGP 实现，避免使用不受支持的旧版本。如暂时无法升级，应在使用前严格校验 .sig 等 ASCII Armor 格式签名文件的来源可信度，不打开来源不明的签名文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a040901-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1782","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2556","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6643","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20738","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0265.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0265","https://github.com/rundeck/rundeck/blob/408c5d3dda3d7834ec6c635ab01bab044b346fa0/cve-suppress.xml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0265.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0265.json","https://github.com/chris-anley/papers/blob/49022789f281abb9549bf3d8df12a62acf6a6554/cve-ids.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0265.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0104","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0264","title":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 用户凭证泄露漏洞","description":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0（又名 BPFTP Server 2.10）存在用户凭证泄露漏洞。当用户查询位于网络共享上的文件信息时，服务器会向共享所在主机发送 NETBIOS 认证凭据，攻击者可通过嗅探同一网络段上的通信流量捕获这些凭据，进而获取目标系统的访问权限。该漏洞影响 Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0 版本，攻击者只需与受影响的 FTP 服务器建立连接并请求网络共享路径上的文件信息即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0264"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59.387","remediation":"升级 Gene6 G6 FTP Server 至 2.2 以上版本以修复凭证泄露问题；如在关键业务中无法升级，建议在 FTP 服务器上禁用 NetBIOS over TCP/IP，并在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 服务器 21 端口的访问仅允许受信来源 IP，同时启用 TLS/SSL 加密传输保护所有认证流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a040301-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2534","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20723","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0264.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0264","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0264.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0264.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vr33-2xp3-c44r/GHSA-vr33-2xp3-c44r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0264.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0103","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0263","title":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 文件存在性泄露漏洞","description":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0（又名 BPFTP Server 2.10）存在文件属性泄露漏洞。当未启用\"显示相对路径\"选项时，远程攻击者可通过 FTP 协议的 SIZE 和 MDTM 命令探测 Web 根目录之外的文件属性，从而获取服务器上敏感文件的存在性、大小及修改时间等信息。该漏洞影响版本 2.0，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0263"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59.273","remediation":"升级 Gene6 G6 FTP Server 至 2.0 以上版本（如已停产则迁移至其他维护中的 FTP 服务器软件）；在服务器配置中启用 \"show relative paths\" 选项，阻止 SIZE 和 MDTM 命令返回 Web 根目录外的文件路径信息；同时在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口（21/TCP）的访问来源，仅允许受信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a040301-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2537","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6330","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20726","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0263.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0263","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0263.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0263.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9xm5-646v-mfcw/GHSA-9xm5-646v-mfcw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0263.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2537/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0397","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0397.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1277","title":"GNU man makewhatis 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-1277是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1277"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:57.123","remediation":"建议立即升级 man 软件包至 1.5i2 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。对于基于 Debian/Ubuntu 的系统，可执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install man-db`；对于基于 Red Hat/CentOS 的系统，可执行 `yum update man` 或 `dnf update man-db`。如暂时无法升级，作为临时缓解措施，可移除 man 组中不受信任用户的写入权限，或通过 `chmod o-x /usr/sbin/makewhatis` 限制非 root 用户执行 makewhatis，防止利用 shell 元字符覆盖任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99227597227747&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-072.html","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=41805","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1277.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1277","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1277.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6a16668a1632a04fd23488d1308b95bb656fd69/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1277.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ccvr-q2fw-7j4w/GHSA-ccvr-q2fw-7j4w.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88024/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1277.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--45381fa8-8524-414b-99fc-b9072c10a1ca.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1277.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0397.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0247","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0309","title":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 inetd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 的 inetd 超级服务守护进程未能正确关闭其内部服务（如 chargen、daytime、echo 等）的套接字连接。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发起大量并发连接请求，消耗系统文件描述符资源，导致 inetd 服务无法响应新的连接请求，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及使用相同 inetd 实现的 Linux 发行版，攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可远程触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0309"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:04.383","remediation":"建议升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.2 补丁版本或更高版本。如无法升级，编辑 /etc/inetd.conf，注释（行首加 #）chargen、daytime、echo、discard 等内部服务行，然后重启 inetd 服务（kill -HUP <inetd_pid> 或 /etc/init.d/inetd restart）；也可迁移至 xinetd 替代传统 inetd 以缓解此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-006.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6380","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0309.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0309","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0309.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0309.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8x55-jj29-5rqp/GHSA-8x55-jj29-5rqp.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/rh_inetd.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0309.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--240a59d4-047e-435a-afbc-f33126bf535f.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0247.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0143","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0143.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0322","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer / Outlook MSHTML.dll 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MSHTML.DLL 是 Internet Explorer 内核中的 HTML 解析器组件，在处理浏览器窗口对象关联的脚本时存在缺陷。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页，利用脚本反复创建和删除与浏览器窗口对象关联的 COM 对象，触发 MSHTML.DLL 解析异常，导致浏览器或 Outlook 应用程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.0 及更早版本以及 Outlook 2000/5.5，攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意页面或邮件，利用条件较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0322"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:05.823","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Internet Explorer 4.0 及 Outlook 2000/5.5，微软已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到 Internet Explorer 11 及以上版本，并将 Outlook 升级到 Office 2016 或更高版本。如无法升级，可禁用 Internet Explorer 中的 Active Scripting 功能（Internet 选项 → 安全 → 自定义级别 → 禁用脚本），或改用 Microsoft Edge / Chrome 等现代浏览器。对于 Outlook，建议禁用 HTML 邮件预览功能或改用纯文本格式阅读邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97958685100219&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2202","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5938","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20552","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0322.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0322","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0322.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0322.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w7f5-4j4j-pr48/GHSA-w7f5-4j4j-pr48.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0322.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c08f630c-6ff5-46d1-87aa-1de1d8e7f8a7.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2202/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633bef0eb7/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0143.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0143.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0139","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0139.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0311","title":"HP OpenView OmniBack II 命令执行漏洞","description":"HP OpenView OmniBack II A.03.50 存在命令执行漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 OmniBack 客户端发送特制请求触发该漏洞，从而在目标系统上以 OmniBack 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 HP 11.x 及更早版本中运行的 OmniBack II A.03.50，Metasploit 框架已集成对应利用模块，攻击者无需高权限即可实施攻击，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0311"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:04.593","remediation":"升级 HP OpenView OmniBack II 至 A.04.00 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，在防火墙上限制对 OmniBack II 服务端口（默认 5555/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接，并禁用不必要的远程管理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2001-q1/0022.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2001-q1/0023.html","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBU