"updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:58.833","remediation":"升级至 SSH 2.0 及以上版本或迁移至 OpenSSH，Secure-RPC 认证机制已在后续版本中被移除。如无法立即升级，可禁用 Secure-RPC 认证（在 sshd_config 中移除或注释 Secure-RPC 相关配置项），并限制本地用户对 ssh-keygen 的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0262.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2222","http://www.ssh.com/products/ssh/patches/secureRPCvulnerability.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5963","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20560","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0259.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0259","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0259.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0259.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_keygen.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pv25-r5h6-xx9c/GHSA-pv25-r5h6-xx9c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0099","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0253","title":"iWeb Hyperseek 2000 目录遍历漏洞","description":"iWeb Hyperseek 2000 的 hsx.cgi 程序存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在 show 参数中构造包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意路径，即可越权读取服务器上的任意文件和目录。该漏洞影响 iWeb Hyperseek 2000 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。成功利用可导致敏感信息泄露，包括配置文件、系统文件等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0253"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:58.177","remediation":"由于 iWeb Hyperseek 2000 已停止维护且厂商不再提供安全更新，建议立即停止使用该产品并迁移至受支持的 Web 搜索方案。若无法替换，需在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache mod_rewrite 或 Nginx）对 hsx.cgi 的 show 参数实施严格的路径白名单过滤，禁止包含 `../` 或绝对路径的请求，同时以最小权限运行 CGI 进程并禁用非必要文件系统访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0463.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/146704","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2314","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6012","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20601","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0253.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0253","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0253.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0253.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m4ww-c97g-rc2h/GHSA-m4ww-c97g-rc2h.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/hsx.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0